20. Simple Navigation Menu
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Navigation Menu</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>My Website</h1>

    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a> |
        <a href="#">About</a> |
        <a href="#">Services</a> |
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <h2>Welcome to My Website</h2>

    <p>This is a simple HTML navigation menu.</p>

</body>
</html>
Output
My Website

Home | About | Services | Contact

Welcome to My Website

This is a simple HTML navigation menu.
